      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9026100::rubric_card::000::8d31f456a8"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The as-cast alloy has a coarse grain size of approximately 98 μm.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9026100::rubric_card::000::8d31f456a8"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The as-cast alloy tends to form non-protective spinel oxides during oxidation.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stationary friction processing with a 12 mm WC cylindrical tool at 400 or 1800 rpm for 5 minutes can be applied to the alloy.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9026100::rubric_card::000::8d31f456a8"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stationary friction processing induces severe plastic deformation.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The relevant oxidation conditions are laboratory air at 850, 950, and 1050 °C for 100 hours.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9026100::rubric_card::000::8d31f456a8"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stationary friction processing refines the grain size from about 98 μm to 1 μm at 400 rpm and 0.43 μm at 1800 rpm.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9026100::rubric_card::000::8d31f456a8"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The refined microstructure has a high density of grain boundaries.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9026100::rubric_card::000::8d31f456a8"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Processing causes a BCC/B2-to-FCC transformation, producing FCC fractions of 38% at 400 rpm and 55% at 1800 rpm.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9026100::rubric_card::000::8d31f456a8"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Processing increases surface free energy relative to the as-cast condition.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9026100::rubric_card::000::8d31f456a8"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The refined microstructure facilitates rapid outward diffusion of Cr and inward diffusion of oxygen.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Processing promotes a dense, continuous protective scale composed predominantly of Al2O3 and Cr2O3.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9026100::rubric_card::000::8d31f456a8"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Processing suppresses the formation of non-protective spinels.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
